<title>SINGAPORE: Parkway chairman sells shares.</title>
<headline>Parkway chairman sells shares.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chairman of property and healthcare group Parkway Holdings Ltd sold 449,000 shares in the company at Singapore $6.06 each on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In a statement to the Stock Exchange of Singapore, Parkway said Tan Chin Nam sold the shares which amounted to 0.143 percent of the company.</p>
<p>After the sale, Tan still holds 52.37 million shares or 16.68 percent of the company.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
